From 90d23a1c361f530830c905b2121c027c96a09b7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Solaira <gustavos@codeaurora.org>
Date: Fri, 1 Jun 2018 01:45:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Enable MHI, QRTR and RMNET_DATA on i.MX

Fix build errors and integration for MDM9x50 + i.MX.
---
 drivers/qti/mhi/controllers/Makefile |  2 +-
 drivers/qti/mhi/core/mhi_pm.c        |  3 +++
 drivers/qti/mhi/devices/mhi_netdev.c | 24 +-----------------------
